{"date": "2026-09-25", "title": "Pop Culture Digest — Friday, September 25, 2026", "link": "https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/", "pubDate": "Fri, 25 Sep 2026 08:00:00 -0500", "description": "\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#111111;padding:24px 18px 20px;color:#ffffff;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9a66b;\">Friday · September 25, 2026</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;margin-top:8px;font-weight:normal;\">Pop Culture Digest</div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#d0d0d0;margin-top:8px;\">What’s actually dominating today</div>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:18px 18px 6px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#444;\">\n    Four stories owning Friday: Taylor Swift’s <em>Showgirl: The Encore</em> is out with four new tracks, Robert Pattinson’s <em>Primetime</em> opens (and Phoebe Bridgers drops the credits song), <em>Avengers: Endgame Encore</em> adds Doctor Doom footage, and Kane Parsons’ <em>Backrooms</em> hits HBO Max.\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <!-- 1 Taylor Swift -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 18px 8px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7c3aed;font-weight:600;\">Music</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:normal;\">Taylor Swift’s <em>Showgirl: The Encore</em> is out — four new tracks, “Patient Zero” video Sunday</h2>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0 0;margin:0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.nme.com/news/music/listen-taylor-swift-bittersweet-single-patient-zero-three-more-encore-tracks-3970801\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n      <img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/img1.jpg\" alt=\"Taylor Swift Showgirl The Encore Patient Zero\" width=\"600\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n    </a>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 18px 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Out today on DSPs: “Patient Zero,” “Cleveland!,” “Pink Clouding,” and “Babylon,” written with Max Martin and Shellback. “Cleveland!” is the Travis Kelce / haters ode. The full “Patient Zero” music video — starring Dakota Johnson and Colin Farrell, directed by Swift with DP Emmanuel Lubezki — premieres at Sunday’s MTV VMAs (Sept. 27), where she also receives the inaugural Artist Director Honors.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.nme.com/news/music/listen-taylor-swift-bittersweet-single-patient-zero-three-more-encore-tracks-3970801\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_nme.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">NME&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/music/2026/09/25/taylor-swift-new-song-cleveland-includes-an-ode-travis-kelce/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_washingtonpost.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">WaPo&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://pitchfork.com/story/taylor-swift-releases-four-new-songs/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_pitchfork.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Pitchfork&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/4hF2gTGuPYlykYuphDxi8J\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_spotify.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Listen on Spotify&nbsp;→</a>\n    </p>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <!-- 2 Primetime -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 18px 8px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b45309;font-weight:600;\">Movies</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:normal;\"><em>Primetime</em> opens: Pattinson as Chris Hansen; Bridgers drops “On Video”</h2>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0 0;margin:0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/primetime-trailer-robert-pattinson-to-catch-predator-1236828508/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n      <img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/img2.jpg\" alt=\"Primetime Robert Pattinson A24\" width=\"600\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n    </a>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 18px 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Lance Oppenheim’s A24 thriller opens theatrically today with Robert Pattinson as Chris Hansen, alongside Merritt Wever, Skyler Gisondo, and Phoebe Bridgers. Bridgers also released the closing-credits song “On Video” today — a double hit for the film’s opening weekend.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/primetime-trailer-robert-pattinson-to-catch-predator-1236828508/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_variety.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Variety&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://pitchfork.com/story/listen-to-phoebe-bridgers-new-song-for-a24-film-primetime/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_pitchfork.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Pitchfork&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5fHXyqQOKL8\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_youtube.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Trailer&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/track/1QA6xgUEZ1BqOj2xuroM3N\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_spotify.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Listen on Spotify&nbsp;→</a>\n    </p>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <!-- 3 Endgame Encore -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 18px 8px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9a3412;font-weight:600;\">Movies</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:normal;\"><em>Avengers: Endgame Encore</em> adds Doctor Doom scenes for <em>Doomsday</em></h2>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0 0;margin:0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/avengers-endgame-encore-new-scenes-doctor-doom-hulk-loki-1236873843/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n      <img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/img3.jpg\" alt=\"Avengers Endgame Encore Marvel\" width=\"600\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n    </a>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 18px 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Theatrical re-release today with about four minutes of new footage — including Robert Downey Jr.’s Doctor Doom — bridging toward <em>Avengers: Doomsday</em> (Dec. 18). Think credits-adjacent Marvel connective tissue more than a full remake; go in fresh if you want the teases unspoiled.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/avengers-endgame-encore-new-scenes-doctor-doom-hulk-loki-1236873843/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_variety.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Variety&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/hollywood/avengers-endgame-encore-4-new-scenes-doomsday-teases-robert-downey-jrs-doctor-doom-10893318/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_indianexpress.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Indian Express&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L2NAh3CIdig\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_youtube.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Trailer&nbsp;→</a>\n    </p>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <!-- 4 Backrooms -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 18px 8px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;font-weight:600;\">Streaming</div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:normal;\"><em>Backrooms</em> hits HBO Max</h2>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0 0;margin:0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/how-to-watch-backrooms-online-streaming-hbo-max-1236798818/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n      <img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/img4.jpg\" alt=\"Backrooms HBO Max A24\" width=\"600\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n    </a>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 18px 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Kane Parsons’ A24 liminal horror, starring Chiwetel Ejiofor, streams exclusively on HBO Max starting today (Sept. 25). Yellow wallpaper, endless corridors, and the viral creepypasta finally get a prestige home — cue the “do not enter” memes.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.polygon.com/backrooms-hbo-max-streaming-september-2026/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_polygon.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Polygon&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/how-to-watch-backrooms-online-streaming-hbo-max-1236798818/\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_variety.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Variety&nbsp;→</a>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;\n      <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0HjdiohVOik\" style=\"color:#111;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://johnmacgaffey.github.io/pop-culture-digest/2026-09-25/images/fav_youtube.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;border:0;margin:0 6px 0 0;width:16px;height:16px;\">Trailer&nbsp;→</a>\n    </p>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <!-- Bottom of the news -->\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 18px 8px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111;font-weight:700;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-top:22px;\">Bottom of the news</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:8px 18px 8px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#333;\">\n    <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;\">\n      <li style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Ryan Murphy told ET he finished a <em>Glee</em> reboot script with Brad Falchuk &amp; Ian Brennan; ~10 original cast members are enthusiastic.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Also opening this weekend: Brad Pitt’s <em>Heart of the Beast</em>, DreamWorks’ <em>Forgotten Island</em>, and Jessica Lange/Ed Harris <em>Long Day’s Journey Into Night</em> (limited).</li>\n      <li style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Hatsune Miku collaborative EP <em>EMERGE M♡DE MIKU</em> is out (Grimes, Odetari, MOLIY, et al.).</li>\n      <li style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Dakota Johnson’s <em>Verity</em> begins its global rollout Sept. 30.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin:0;\">MTV VMAs Sunday (Sept. 27): Madonna leads nominations; Taylor’s full “Patient Zero” video + Artist Director Honors.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 18px 36px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#888;border-top:1px solid #eee;\">\n    Pop Culture Digest · curated for John · sent once daily<br>\n    Friday, September 25, 2026 · from popculture@agentmail.to\n  </td></tr>\n\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n"}